# Build context "." (infra/Dockerfile.frontend in docker-compose*.yml). The
# frontend build only copies frontend/, but keep secrets and bulky local state
# out of the context in case a COPY ever gets wider. The backend image has its
# own backend/.dockerignore (context ./backend).

# Secrets (.env.prod, backend/.env and backups such as .env.bak-*)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/*.example

.git
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
backend/data
Eingang/
